ntent. The title combines narrative-driven progression with exploration, character development, and minigames typical of the series.", "themes": [{"id": 1, "name": "Action"}, {"id": 31, "name": "Drama"}], "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/like-a-dragon-infinite-wealth", "videos": [{"id": 74692, "name": "Announcement Trailer", "video_id": "Fx0YMVgCD5E", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Fx0YMVgCD5E", "title": "\u300e\u9f8d\u304c\u5982\u304f\uff18\u300f\u30c6\u30a3\u30b6\u30fc\u30c8\u30ec\u30fc\u30e9\u30fc", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/Fx0YMVgCD5E/sddefault.jpg"}, {"id": 91678, "name": "Trailer", "video_id": "3Q1HRYrO1Gw", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=3Q1HRYrO1Gw", "title": "Like a Dragon: Infinite Wealth Reveal Trailer", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/3Q1HRYrO1Gw/maxresdefault.jpg"}, {"id": 102521, "name": "Trailer", "video_id": "1tG0Cbr2wVY", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=1tG0Cbr2wVY", "title": "Like A Dragon: Infinite Wealth - Story Preview | PC Gaming Show: Most Wanted 2023", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/1tG0Cbr2wVY/maxresdefault.jpg"}, {"id": 100417, "name": "Gameplay Trailer", "video_id": "yU6qZi6zxRY", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=yU6qZi6zxRY", "title": "LIKE A DRAGON: INFINITE WEALTH | Dondoko Island Reveal Trailer", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/yU6qZi6zxRY/maxresdefault.jpg"}, {"id": 98216, "name": "Release Date Trailer", "video_id": "BpmYdgZc-bM", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=BpmYdgZc-bM", "title": "Like a Dragon: Infinite Wealth | Story trailer", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/BpmYdgZc-bM/maxresdefault.jpg"}, {"id": 98331, "name": "Gameplay Trailer", "video_id": "jeTFK18PjnM", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=jeTFK18PjnM", "title": "LIKE A DRAGON: INFINITE WEALTH | GAMEPLAY REVEAL TRAILER", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/jeTFK18PjnM/maxresdefault.jpg"}, {"id": 175597, "name": "Launch Trailer", "video_id": "H_GCywy6uhY", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=H_GCywy6uhY", "title": 